<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#07111f] py-24 sm:py-32">
  <div class="page-shell">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.72fr_1.28fr] lg:items-start">
      <div>
        <div class="reveal-on-scroll chip mb-6">
          <span class="mini-label">Founder note</span>
        </div>
        <p class="reveal-on-scroll max-w-sm text-lg font-semibold leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
          Why we are building VoluChat for commerce operators first.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal-on-scroll max-w-4xl">
        <blockquote class="text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.14] text-white sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">
          “Growing stores do not lose revenue only because the product is weak. They lose it because the team cannot act on every cart, stock signal, customer question, and follow-up at the right time.”
        </blockquote>
        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 border-t border-white/10 pt-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] lg:items-end">
          <p class="max-w-2xl text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
            We built VoluChat to give Indian Shopify brands an agent layer that does the repetitive operating work while founders keep control over discounts, customer messages, and brand judgment.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-400 lg:text-right">
            Vaibhav Goyal<br />
            <span class="font-medium text-slate-500">Founder, VoluChat</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
